the-firm-as-one-program-78 = unlines (cons "- **S2** The market concentrates toward the firm built as one program in hyperactivity ([S1: The gains multiply instead of adding, which changes the firm's rate of learning (all of layer 3)])." (cons "  Electronic trading is close to a zero-sum contest between firms over the same flow, and market share already concentrates toward the firms with the best technology. A discontinuity in technology produces a discontinuity in concentration: the firm built as one program takes opportunities first, correctly, at full size, everywhere, and its competitors trade against a counterparty that is better informed and quicker to adapt. That is why a figure of several billion understates it." nil))
